        "created_at": "2014-01-02T03:17:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Better - have the Argent Adept in the game along with original Expatriette and Bunker.&nbsp; In the ideal circumstance, Unity can play two cards with Swift Bot, Bunker two with Upgrade Mode, Expat can use Speed Loading and Load to get three out in one turn, and Argent can make players play at least three cards during his turn (perform Alacritous Subdominant and accompany Inventive Preparation), more if he has a chain running or a Silver Shadow in hand.</p>",
